text.section:
Within 30 days after the happening of any of the following events, an amendment to a certificate of limited partnership reflecting the occurrence of the event or events shall be filed:

The admission of a new general partner;


The withdrawal of a general partner;


The continuation of the business under § 50-73.49 after an event of withdrawal of a general partner;


A change in the name of the limited partnership or the address of the principal office; or


One or more liquidating trustees commence the winding up of the affairs of the limited partnership, in which event the certificate of amendment shall include the name and the business, residence or mailing address of each liquidating trustee.
